    "innovation": "This paper introduces the CMIP6 Sea-Ice Model Intercomparison Project (SIMIP), a diagnostic initiative that establishes a standardized data request for sea-ice variables to facilitate systematic analysis of the heat, momentum, and mass budgets, thereby improving the understanding and simulation of sea ice in climate models.",
