            "paragraph": "To address these issues, a specific model-intercomparison project related to sea ice, namely the Sea-Ice Model Intercomparison Project (SIMIP), has been endorsed as an official part of the 6th phase of the Coupled Model Intercomparison Project (CMIP6; Eyring et al., 2016), which is coordinated by the World Climate Research Programme (WCRP).",
